WEBVTT

00:00:00.980 --> 00:00:03.660
I <i>told</i>  you...

00:00:03.660 --> 00:00:06.490
Don't sit so close while you're watching!!

00:00:08.270 --> 00:00:09.460
Darling?

00:00:10.640 --> 00:00:12.460
Hey, Darling...!

00:00:18.330 --> 00:00:20.430
W-W-What's with that outfit?!

00:00:20.430 --> 00:00:23.380
It's summer vacation, so let's go to the beach!

00:00:23.380 --> 00:00:25.180
Who'd want to go with <i>you?!</i>

00:00:25.180 --> 00:00:29.210
So you say, but haven't you been
dreaming about me lately, Darling?

00:00:29.210 --> 00:00:30.520
Dreaming about you?

00:00:33.440 --> 00:00:37.320
Are your dreams about me a sign that we're making progress?

00:00:37.320 --> 00:00:38.600
My first time being dreamed about~

00:00:38.600 --> 00:00:39.060
SHUT UP!!
My first time being dreamed about~

00:00:39.060 --> 00:00:39.870
SHUT UP!!

00:00:39.870 --> 00:00:41.720
I have no control over my dreams!

00:00:41.720 --> 00:00:44.380
I'm being thrown around
in a bikini for the first time!

00:02:17.900 --> 00:02:21.340
Love Letter Panic! A Romantic Predicament!?

00:02:26.610 --> 00:02:27.850
You're too naﾃｯve!

00:02:29.290 --> 00:02:30.350
Just watch...

00:02:32.610 --> 00:02:34.280
You see, the allure of a swimsuit...

00:02:35.470 --> 00:02:37.120
...is like this!

00:02:38.070 --> 00:02:41.840
Thanks to these charms, Iwaki-kun and I will have a wonderful summer romance.

00:02:41.840 --> 00:02:43.580
And I will be like Snow White.

00:02:43.580 --> 00:02:45.000
Snow White?

00:02:45.000 --> 00:02:48.050
With a kiss from the prince,
she gains miraculous powers...

00:02:48.050 --> 00:02:50.300
...and blossoms into the
beautiful princess, Snow White!

00:02:50.630 --> 00:02:54.390
Likewise, love can only enter its full splendor with a kiss!

00:02:54.840 --> 00:02:57.030
And with summer vacation comes the chance for love!

00:02:57.030 --> 00:03:01.230
I shall invite Iwaki-kun to the beach,
and make him mine with my adult allure!

00:03:01.230 --> 00:03:04.980
I'm sorry, Rizel-chan, but you have no chance of win-

00:03:09.820 --> 00:03:11.320
Papa C, you're so cool!

00:03:12.240 --> 00:03:13.830
Oh my, I've...!

00:03:13.830 --> 00:03:18.030
I'm gonna do my best
with my husband at the beach!

00:03:20.700 --> 00:03:21.790
Aoi-chan!

00:03:22.430 --> 00:03:23.870
What is it <i>this</i>  time?

00:03:23.870 --> 00:03:25.890
Are you going for it, too?

00:03:25.890 --> 00:03:27.170
Going for what?

00:03:27.170 --> 00:03:31.710
Summer vacation! Like what I'm going to go for with my husband at the beach...

00:03:34.880 --> 00:03:36.140
Darling...

00:03:36.450 --> 00:03:37.890
Rizel...

00:03:39.870 --> 00:03:43.480
Or maybe back in our room at the hotel...

00:03:43.830 --> 00:03:45.910
Oh no ~!

00:03:46.350 --> 00:03:47.860
Darling...

00:03:48.140 --> 00:03:49.360
Rizel...

00:03:51.420 --> 00:03:55.050
Or even at the beach house...

00:03:56.530 --> 00:03:58.030
Darling...

00:03:58.030 --> 00:03:59.540
Rizel...

00:04:01.230 --> 00:04:02.910
Hafuun!

00:04:02.910 --> 00:04:05.000
Don't you feel the same way, Aoi-chan?

00:04:05.000 --> 00:04:06.170
Huh?

00:04:08.730 --> 00:04:11.080
It <i>is</i>  the summer of
our last year in middle school,

00:04:11.080 --> 00:04:13.100
so it's natural to kiss someone you like.

00:04:13.100 --> 00:04:15.590
Summer break might be my last chance.

00:04:15.850 --> 00:04:18.060
Aoi-chan, do you have a husband, too?

00:04:18.060 --> 00:04:21.970
O-Of course not! Although there's someone I wouldn't mind having...

00:04:21.970 --> 00:04:23.760
What's his name?

00:04:24.500 --> 00:04:25.390
Oh, no...

00:04:25.390 --> 00:04:27.520
Tell me! I'll help you out!

00:04:27.520 --> 00:04:28.090
Huh?

00:04:28.090 --> 00:04:30.730
Aoi-chan, you've helped me out
so much already...

00:04:30.730 --> 00:04:33.380
...so I'll write a love letter for you in return!

00:04:33.380 --> 00:04:34.190
Rizel-chan...

00:04:34.190 --> 00:04:35.910
So, what's his name?

00:04:36.300 --> 00:04:38.350
Don't tell anyone else, okay?

00:04:38.350 --> 00:04:39.070
Okay!

00:04:39.390 --> 00:04:42.950
Okay... It's Hououin Ryuunosuke-kun, from Class A.

00:04:42.950 --> 00:04:44.350
Ohmigod, I said it!!

00:04:44.350 --> 00:04:45.540
Class A?

00:04:45.540 --> 00:04:47.180
I don't know him.

00:04:47.180 --> 00:04:50.360
No way! He's only like the coolest, most popular boy around.

00:04:50.940 --> 00:04:53.590
I know a <i>Sei</i> nosuke-kun, but...

00:04:53.590 --> 00:04:55.110
Was there somebody by that name?

00:04:55.110 --> 00:04:56.510
Anyway, Ryuunosuke-kun, right?

00:04:56.510 --> 00:04:58.130
Y-Yes...

00:05:00.320 --> 00:05:02.480
Ah, okay, I get it...

00:05:02.790 --> 00:05:06.020
"You are the light of my heart..."

00:05:13.000 --> 00:05:14.900
Oh, well...

00:05:19.220 --> 00:05:20.860
Aoi-chan, it's ready!

00:05:21.800 --> 00:05:24.530
B-But... Do I have to give this to him?

00:05:24.530 --> 00:05:24.990
Yep!

00:05:24.990 --> 00:05:28.500
But if I <i>do</i>  give it to him, and things work out...!

00:05:29.680 --> 00:05:31.920
Ah, I knew it! I can't do it~!

00:05:31.920 --> 00:05:34.130
Then let me handle that, too!

00:05:34.130 --> 00:05:35.730
I'm off to Class A!

00:05:36.270 --> 00:05:37.500
She left...

00:05:38.480 --> 00:05:39.510
Good luck!

00:05:39.510 --> 00:05:40.380
Zoom!

00:05:40.380 --> 00:05:43.260
Is there a Hououin Ryuunosuke-kun here?

00:05:43.260 --> 00:05:45.090
Oh, my dear maiden!

00:05:45.090 --> 00:05:48.130
Ah! Baranoshin-kun, is Ryuunosuke-kun here?

00:05:49.000 --> 00:05:52.140
What's going on? Is this some kind of joke?

00:05:52.140 --> 00:05:55.270
If so, it would be tactless of me to give her a serious reply...

00:05:55.790 --> 00:05:57.320
What's it about?

00:05:57.320 --> 00:05:58.990
I want to give this to him!

00:05:58.990 --> 00:06:00.570
Why, Th-th-th-this is...!!!

00:06:00.570 --> 00:06:03.700
Yeah, a love letter! Well, see you later...

00:06:04.200 --> 00:06:07.020
I see! She finally made up her mind,

00:06:07.020 --> 00:06:11.620
but she was so embarrassed that she resorted to this cute and innocent method to tell me!

00:06:11.970 --> 00:06:16.880
My dear maiden, I shall read your letter now,
before this wonderful feeling fades away!

00:06:18.170 --> 00:06:20.460
I can't believe it! Love~!

00:06:27.560 --> 00:06:31.100
It's fine! You'll do fine! Go for it!
What should I do? What should I do now?!

00:06:31.100 --> 00:06:32.390
Darling!

00:06:32.950 --> 00:06:37.060
Hououin was clutching some kind of letter,
and then he went bright red and collapsed.

00:06:37.060 --> 00:06:39.390
Really?! We did it!

00:06:39.390 --> 00:06:40.270
Y-Yeah...

00:06:40.270 --> 00:06:43.310
Next, the two of you will go on your first date next Sunday...

00:06:43.310 --> 00:06:47.320
...and one thing will lead to another,
and then over summer vacation...

00:06:48.390 --> 00:06:52.080
No way! It's still too soon for that!
We're still in middle school, after all.

00:06:52.580 --> 00:06:57.430
A library book I read said that 97% of middle-schoolers have gone to "B"!

00:06:57.430 --> 00:07:00.260
No way! "B," you said? What is this "B"?!

00:07:00.260 --> 00:07:04.640
Let's see, "A" is a hot kiss,
so "B" must be an extra-hot kiss!

00:07:04.640 --> 00:07:06.840
Noo, that's too intense!

00:07:06.840 --> 00:07:07.450
No, no, it's fine!

00:07:07.450 --> 00:07:09.010
Whatever...
No, no, it's fine!

00:07:12.030 --> 00:07:14.980
Why're <i>you</i>  in such a good mood this morning?

00:07:15.540 --> 00:07:18.300
Because today is Aoi-chan's date!

00:07:18.300 --> 00:07:20.690
I'm wondering how far they'll go...

00:07:20.690 --> 00:07:23.010
Who would go that far on the first date?

00:07:23.010 --> 00:07:27.280
"B"? Or maybe up to "C"??
Huh? What is "C," anyway?

00:07:27.280 --> 00:07:29.110
Rizel's misguided beliefs, Part 2:
"C" = <u>c</u>houatsui kisu (super-extra-hot kiss)
Super-extra-hot kiss?

00:07:29.110 --> 00:07:33.230
Anyway, does she know what went on between you and Hououin?

00:07:34.670 --> 00:07:37.160
It's already this late?! Say, Darling,

00:07:37.160 --> 00:07:41.290
if Aoi-chan's date goes well,
will you kiss me as a reward?

00:07:41.290 --> 00:07:42.410
What?!

00:07:42.410 --> 00:07:47.270
Because... the prince gives a miraculous kiss
to the hardworking damsel!

00:07:47.860 --> 00:07:50.060
DON'T GIVE ME THAT SHIT!

00:07:50.060 --> 00:07:53.520
I'm off~!

00:08:00.750 --> 00:08:02.900
Aoi-chan's so cute!

00:08:02.900 --> 00:08:04.530
With looks like that, she can't go wrong!

00:08:06.880 --> 00:08:08.690
R-Ryuunosuke-kun!

00:08:08.690 --> 00:08:10.030
Hey, Seimoto-san!

00:08:10.030 --> 00:08:12.400
Ah... er... T-Today-

00:08:12.400 --> 00:08:14.450
What a coincidence! Are you on a date, too?

00:08:15.030 --> 00:08:17.310
I'm also going on a date, with Rizel-chan!

00:08:19.180 --> 00:08:21.290
Ehh?! Why, why?!

00:08:21.290 --> 00:08:24.300
How come Harudanji-kun is here, and not Ryuunosuke-kun?

00:08:24.300 --> 00:08:27.260
Heh, you always were such a kidder!

00:08:27.730 --> 00:08:29.720
This person <i>is</i>  Ryuunosuke-kun.

00:08:29.720 --> 00:08:31.140
EEEHHHHH??!!!

00:08:32.700 --> 00:08:37.050
Come now, my dear maiden.
Shall we enjoy this day together?

00:08:37.050 --> 00:08:38.260
"Dear maiden"?

00:08:38.260 --> 00:08:40.980
I only came to watch because I was worried about Aoi-chan.

00:08:40.980 --> 00:08:45.820
Silly girl... Did you not give me this passionate letter of love?

00:08:45.820 --> 00:08:50.280
Yeah, but it was from Aoi-chan, for you...

00:08:50.280 --> 00:08:52.740
I forgot to sign the name!!

00:08:52.900 --> 00:08:55.490
Um... So, well, you see...

00:08:55.490 --> 00:08:59.280
Um, go for it, you two! Bye-bye now!

00:08:59.280 --> 00:09:00.400
Wait!

00:09:00.400 --> 00:09:02.710
You are the only one in my heart!

00:09:02.710 --> 00:09:05.910
No, I never thought of you that way...

00:09:05.910 --> 00:09:10.140
But you came to my home!
You praised my collection!

00:09:10.480 --> 00:09:14.100
I shall never forget that blessed hour.

00:09:15.610 --> 00:09:17.130
What's going on, Rizel-chan?

00:09:17.130 --> 00:09:18.660
Well...

00:09:18.660 --> 00:09:20.950
Did you do those things with Ryuunosuke-kun?

00:09:20.950 --> 00:09:23.940
Well, no... but on some level, yes...

00:09:23.940 --> 00:09:25.650
Why didn't you tell me?!

00:09:25.650 --> 00:09:27.950
Well... how should I put it...

00:09:27.950 --> 00:09:30.360
I hate you! I hate you, Rizel-chan!

00:09:30.360 --> 00:09:32.570
Ah! Wait, Aoi-chan!

00:09:32.570 --> 00:09:34.410
Wait, Aoi-chan!!

00:09:38.500 --> 00:09:39.830
Ryuunosuke-kun!

00:09:39.830 --> 00:09:42.280
You finally remembered! I'm so happy!

00:09:42.280 --> 00:09:46.200
Aoi-chan really, truly loves you,
Ryuunosuke-kun!

00:09:46.200 --> 00:09:49.830
Aoi-chan is always so cheerful,
and she's even stronger than most boys...

00:09:49.830 --> 00:09:53.450
...yet when it comes to you,
she gets nervous and weak in the knees!

00:09:53.450 --> 00:09:55.290
She likes you so much!

00:09:56.110 --> 00:09:59.860
She likes you so much,
yet she gets nothing in return.

00:09:59.860 --> 00:10:02.460
She must feel so sad...

00:10:02.460 --> 00:10:03.680
So...

00:10:04.150 --> 00:10:06.640
So please go out with Aoi-chan!

00:10:06.640 --> 00:10:09.490
I could say the same thing to you.

00:10:09.490 --> 00:10:10.640
Huh?

00:10:10.640 --> 00:10:14.100
My feelings for you are the same.

00:10:14.100 --> 00:10:17.260
But, I'm married...

00:10:17.260 --> 00:10:20.100
That is why I cannot go out with Seimoto-san.

00:10:20.100 --> 00:10:21.540
But... but...!

00:10:23.140 --> 00:10:24.200
But...

00:10:25.290 --> 00:10:27.950
Then what should I do?

00:10:27.950 --> 00:10:31.840
I just want everyone to be happy.
Is that so wrong?

00:10:32.730 --> 00:10:33.760
Well, then...

00:10:35.220 --> 00:10:38.640
Papas A, B, and C!
There's something I need to find!

00:10:38.640 --> 00:10:40.060
Bring out the airplane!

00:10:41.320 --> 00:10:45.570
They are called the Phantom
Bear-Print Panties, the '41 Princess.

00:10:45.570 --> 00:10:49.690
If you can bring them to me, I will consider going out with Seimoto-san.

00:10:49.690 --> 00:10:50.760
Really?!

00:10:50.760 --> 00:10:52.900
I do not lie.

00:10:54.830 --> 00:10:56.780
Just wait! I'll do it, no matter what!

00:10:57.090 --> 00:10:59.870
The '41 Princess?! That's impossible!

00:10:59.870 --> 00:11:01.110
Why?!

00:11:01.110 --> 00:11:05.830
The '41 Princess is a pair of bear-print panties worthy of the title, "Phantom."

00:11:06.520 --> 00:11:10.260
Ever since they were carelessly dropped by the English mountaineer, Storm Black,

00:11:10.260 --> 00:11:16.510
near the peak of Mt. Everest,
their whereabouts have been unknown.

00:11:16.510 --> 00:11:21.570
He left a will bequeathing them to the one who can find them.

00:11:21.570 --> 00:11:24.550
Although many mountaineers have attempted the search,

00:11:24.550 --> 00:11:26.810
the panties have never been found.

00:11:27.270 --> 00:11:29.690
I'm sorry, Aoi-chan.

00:11:30.210 --> 00:11:32.600
I wasn't able to find them...

00:11:39.670 --> 00:11:41.200
Rizel-chan! You're awake!

00:11:41.200 --> 00:11:45.820
Aoi-chan! That's right!
I have to go search for them...

00:11:45.820 --> 00:11:47.500
It's all right now.

00:11:47.800 --> 00:11:52.270
It was wrong of me to get mad at you,
after I'd depended on you for so much.

00:11:52.580 --> 00:11:56.430
I'm going to try to be brave and do my best, even though it might not work out!

00:11:56.730 --> 00:11:58.260
Aoi-chan!

00:11:58.260 --> 00:12:00.910
At any rate, please get a little more sleep.

00:12:00.910 --> 00:12:01.790
Okay.

00:12:06.940 --> 00:12:08.550
You really went all-out.

00:12:10.530 --> 00:12:12.400
Just for a friend...

00:12:12.870 --> 00:12:14.580
You're not so bad after all.

00:12:15.320 --> 00:12:17.470
So how about that reward kiss?

00:12:17.470 --> 00:12:19.010
Y-Y-You were awake?!

00:12:19.010 --> 00:12:22.000
Yep! Come on, give me the reward kiss!

00:12:22.000 --> 00:12:24.830
C-Cut it out!! To hell with
your "reward kiss," you idiot!

00:12:24.830 --> 00:12:26.460
My beautiful reward!!! Argghh!

00:12:26.710 --> 00:12:27.960
You're such a pest!

00:12:28.210 --> 00:12:29.890
Kiss, kiss!

00:12:29.890 --> 00:12:32.870
Give it up already! No way am I kissing you!!

00:12:32.870 --> 00:12:34.350
Nooo~~!!

00:14:10.160 --> 00:14:11.690
What? Me again?!

00:14:11.690 --> 00:14:15.900
What? How do I like living with Rizel, so far?

00:14:15.900 --> 00:14:19.680
She always puts in the best effort she can.
I'll give her that much, but...

00:14:19.680 --> 00:14:23.830
It's not like I've accepted being "married" to her, got it?

00:14:27.130 --> 00:14:30.880
What? Me again?! You people have too much time on your hands.

00:14:30.880 --> 00:14:34.450
What? How do I like living with Rizel, so far?

00:14:34.450 --> 00:14:35.960
Well, let's see...

00:14:35.960 --> 00:14:38.520
She's just as big a pain as ever, although...

00:14:38.520 --> 00:14:44.040
...she always puts in the best effort she can.
I'll give her that much, but...

00:14:44.040 --> 00:14:46.640
Now wait, don't go jumping to conclusions!

00:14:46.640 --> 00:14:50.440
It's not like I've accepted being "married" to her, got it?

00:14:50.440 --> 00:14:53.100
Just don't go getting the wrong idea, okay?
